or Liabilities of the Acquired Companies.  There are, and since the Formation Date there have been, no material Proceedings by any Acquired Company pending against any other Person. No Acquired Company is or has been, since the</font><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </font></p></div>
